From 68f73d73c90393258da0c31a23fcb25b0472d537 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:39:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] estuary: the tab of the page shown keeps its block while the
 focus is on the button

The tabs of the player information were buttons with alternative textures for
the page shown (usealttexture): Kodi reads those only for a toggle button
(GUIControlFactory.cpp, GUICONTROL_TOGGLEBUTTON); a plain button takes them and
never shows them. So when the focus went from the tabs to the button of the
output, no tab said which page was shown (as in 1.0). The tabs are now toggle
buttons: the tab of the page shown keeps a dark block while the focus is
elsewhere, and the focus is the warm one. Their size, labels, navigation and
actions are as before. The dialog of system/hades is made again.
---
 addons/skin.estuary/xml/DialogPlayerProcessInfo.xml | 12 ++++++------
 system/hades/DialogHadesPlayerInfo.xml              | 10 +++++-----
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

